text Naranja_Route666_Text_081C17A8 {
    "I can see it in your face. You want\nto challenge me."
}

text Naranja_Route666_Text_081C17DD {
    "Awawawawawa..."
}

text Naranja_Route666_Text_081C17EC {
    "A well-played match leaves me feeling\nrefreshed and serene."
}

text Naranja_Route666_Text_081C1828 {
    "Do you have a rival whom you just\nhate to lose against?"
}

text Naranja_Route666_Text_081C1860 {
    "Arrrgh! I hate losing!"
}

text Naranja_Route666_Text_081C1877 {
    "If you have a rival, don’t you get the\nfeeling that you have to keep getting\lbetter?"
}

text Naranja_Route666_Text_081C18CC {
    "Through fishing, I have attained a\nstate of becalmed serenity...\lPlease, allow me to demonstrate..."
}

text Naranja_Route666_Text_081C1930 {
    "Though I have lost, my heart remains\ncalm..."
}

text Naranja_Route666_Text_081C195D {
    "It matters not that I catch nothing.\nThe line remains in the water..."
}

text Naranja_Route666_Text_081C19A3 {
    "Whoops! Don’t tell me I snagged\na SURFING POKéMON?"
}

text Naranja_Route666_Text_081C19D6 {
    "I can’t keep up!"
}

text Naranja_Route666_Text_081C19E7 {
    "Your POKéMON look pretty strong.\nThey’d be a handful if I hooked them!"
}

text Naranja_Route666_Text_081C1A2E {
    "Well, hey! This is a match between a\nPOKéMON fan and a fishing buff!"
}

text Naranja_Route666_Text_081C1A73 {
    "No! My line’s all tangled!\nThe party’s over!"
}

text Naranja_Route666_Text_081C1AA0 {
    "My fishing line’s doing a dance!\nThe tangle tango! Hahaha, snarl!"
}

text Naranja_Route666_Text_081C1AE2 {
    "What I learned at DEWFORD’s POKéMON\nGYM, I will put into practice here."
}

text Naranja_Route666_Text_081C1B2A {
    "I was swamped!"
}

text Naranja_Route666_Text_081C1B39 {
    "BRAWLY, DEWFORD’s GYM LEADER, used\nto train with a guy named BRUNO in\lKANTO, I’ve heard."
}

text Naranja_Route666_Text_081C1B92 {
    "BIRD POKéMON have excellent vision.\nThey spot prey from great heights."
}

text Naranja_Route666_Text_081C1BD9 {
    "Whew... I give up."
}

text Naranja_Route666_Text_081C1BEC {
    "There’re lots of diving spots in the\nsea around here.\pYou can spot them easily from the sky\nbecause of their darker color."
}
